# With the resident turned off in the catalog (Q3-08) her first wish still comes, from the tray:
# its card has no portrait and the thanks on the ribbon are signed by nobody.
expect wishes 0
set played 29
wait 70
expect wish first_flowers open
expect portrait 0 no
place flowers_white @24,34
place flowers_white @25,34
wait 20
set played 40
wait 4
expect wish first_flowers done
expect ribbon yes
expect thanks not —
shot shots/no_resident.png
quit
